					"nextDialogs": [
						150470414
					],
					"speakerTitle": "幼暝视龙"
				},
				{
					"id": 150470414,
					"content": "哈…不行…它根本听不懂鳍游龙的叫声啊！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150470415
					],
					"speakerTitle": "玛拉妮"
				},
				{
					"id": 150470415,
					"content": "要不然…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150470416
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 150470416,
					"content": "…我又想起来了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150470417
					],
					"speakerTitle": "玛拉妮"
				},
				{
					"id": 150470417,
					"content": "又想起什么？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150470418
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 150470418,
					"content": "我听伊法说过，暝视龙最喜欢吃的就是微光角菌，正好我随身带着。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150470419
					],
					"speakerTitle": "玛拉妮"
				},
				{
					"id": 150470419,
					"content": "太好了太好了，这下有救了！给它吃完肯定就能互通心意了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150470420
					],
					"speakerTitle": "玛拉妮"
				},
				{
					"id": 150470420,
					"content": "！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150470421
					],
					"speakerTitle": "幼暝视龙"
				},
				{
					"id": 150470421,
					"content": "出远门的物资就是要多准备些才行…卡齐娜提醒得一点没错。谢谢你呀，卡齐…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150470422
					],
					"speakerTitle": "玛拉妮"
				},
				{
					"id": 150470422,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150470423
					],
					"speakerTitle": "幼暝视龙"
				},
				{
					"id": 150470423,
					"content": "这…并没有互通心意的征兆…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150470424
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 150470424,
					"content": "完蛋了…征服浪浪湾所有项目的梦想在出航的第一日真的翻船了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150470425
					],
					"speakerTitle": "玛拉妮"
				},
				{
					"id": 150470425,
					"content": "#{NICKNAME}，大英雄{NICKNAME}，你有什么办法吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150470426,
						150470427
					],
					"speakerTitle": "玛拉妮"
				},
				{
					"id": 150470426,
					"content": "办法的确有…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150470428
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 150470428,
					"content": "嗯，好吧…那就辛苦你了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
