				},
				{
					"id": 150470505,
					"content": "#呃，{M#他}{F#她}，{M#他}{F#她}突然肚子疼上厕所去了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150470506
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 150470506,
					"content": "（为什么是那么蹩脚的理由…算了，玛拉妮没有看出异样就好…）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
